{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30016_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:112cc1b404de830899f7e78e3facc3154e6ce9f1195db2f5d04c26e8781019ef",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41dd62a02781ae5ad6713bfaba3286fba4a41cda4df06e17fc62c96304d85256",
      "text": "夕阳胶卷",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c17ae7759d557f58b32653d24de7174da6ae7e0cb25597d0635e2d52cad8a5b2",
      "text": "确定出演数码相机宣传活动的神速一魂。\n两人决定亲自去拍摄照片。\n听到拍摄主题后，朱雀觉得这对玄武来说，\n会不会是一份很难完成的工作，于是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000016:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000016:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41dd62a02781ae5ad6713bfaba3286fba4a41cda4df06e17fc62c96304d85256",
      "text": "夕阳胶卷",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:392d6b70e94acf46916a244d7b4c906a13bf81724b61c8a5e982641a6d7eb369",
      "text": "辛苦啦，●●●●●●●●●●番长。\n找上我们的新工作是什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31010fcbe2b264ade8002f5e6ea4a62914437e21f44c09ef7c8d19d907245f33",
      "text": "好的！是新发售的数码相机的\n宣传活动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3f024ad104ba72a2c0a90520ed92280e0d87a0c8796c304751917c657b9b07b",
      "text": "找我们的，居然是相机！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1692c59691c334c861b8afe1c2da17d5dcc7692bf311b0c5fc459ae989a30def",
      "text": "是的。听说这次的宣传活动\n是以年轻群体为目标客户，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e0d7094e3f4ce21964e0cdcc2d995d3146ff56eedfb4fc5d0129620ebd1184c",
      "text": "对方非常坚决地希望\n“务必请身为现役高中生的神速一魂来代言”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1dbefcca380678e9b311a41a6f740b367076b393c4ab15ca1596f9efc34c45a2",
      "text": "同时，他们还想把《オモイノウタ》\n作为形象歌曲来使用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87a95982373bd198a6a8b0d8b8f2bcb0132815e22ce2fd66d7c9b04af83b5aeb",
      "text": "哦哦！真的假的啊！\n这不是挺会说话的嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92676df130f98dd2d5ad9225285bc105164ba1f70ad9315640786a4ccfd886e7",
      "text": "既然都说到这份上了，那就干了！\n你说呢，玄武？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ba1b4334aebf094a53b571c85c987fdf0015af803b84c66e4af39a0c123bf47",
      "text": "啊啊，那是自然。\n看来对方对我们的期待相当高啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25c8929d6d996b5f59eb399c6c73286ca7f74ebe4c378d109fcde008ec462670",
      "text": "意气轩昂。打起精神来上吧，搭档！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fba3ffbb76bd0c2cdf51e78042e9191b571fd0d0d99d173c4bf24c504215e0c",
      "text": "对台本当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e3ab9632d57cb07710a8bf6772a58fdcc197c7d6544f421373a88230d168071",
      "text": "本次企划的宣传活动主题是\n“用照片留下珍贵的回忆”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f7ae6c98b2d03370121abcf1c26c554c2c404c24323beb6910de0a038df24bc",
      "text": "我们希望两位能用这款新相机的样机去拍些照片，\n并以此作为广告素材来使用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:629237e675956e5a2509d7e6e4faa9d31da4a8d550935170b212e6b84b31ed0c",
      "text": "身边的喜欢的事物、珍视的人、风景，或是触动\n内心的东西等等，希望二位能自由地去拍摄。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8eea3ac7fd349290ee9c1422c07106248d0fc83ddbebcae23aa33509bdb82d84",
      "text": "新产品的相机，一共有两款类型呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5347794ee5c13877664f6578bd7199c24ed149173ae9ee8074ba694f6c383e4c",
      "text": "喔喔！两款都帅呆了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31a8c620f390f9b1f6870dcc6b96d2ba22aaaab9fb9eae407a1e0ee8116786ef",
      "text": "啊啊。连颜色，都简直像是为我们量身定做的一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:155cb6521120542537e389f378d393d8055b537b7ee5f9489653f97554a39a39",
      "text": "非常感谢！我们也是根据两位的形象特点，\n特意准备了这个颜色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d17c8214d1c5b9d27f575dd8c7bec38062b5d9d0314ac559a0913979abd80fd",
      "text": "这款相机的卖点就是操作便捷。使用方法\n非常简单，只要按下电源开关，就能立刻拍摄。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d6cf2ee397734c6c02f75e80f71308429c62a17b0a206a4509e6db29be426e7",
      "text": "请试着操作看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:792f23d8ec08b3af9e5fd5c4aab91f9626157456919c98163dab08d42ab3bfb6",
      "text": "噢，按下电源……哦，亮了。\n好，喵子，稍微往这边看一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea2adc4477387fa8351a5d472c0e3e247016824ff71edd7bf5a0fc6eaf87b6e4",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9436093c0f2f6376096dab7ae8175961cde9770716d8e9b32195d483f106d77",
      "text": "拍得很棒嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62da91da543db5dd976c4a9eef3afc0732304189a24ac24d3df8f168df526d2c",
      "text": "拍身边亲近的伙伴或者家人的照片也很不错呢！\n如果可以的话，那种照片也拜托二位了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a40892c1e9acda16ba91fc821de515d11127522559fbe950338ca6e4fc4f5aa",
      "text": "家人啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98e43d1005fcffb54bf1fe73528ab08fed70dcbefaaa35a10438b3934f658ead",
      "text": "（老爹和老妈的照片吗。唔——……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_b:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9465e7cd5cd0563e68de264bb4f85f75dd98147a8fe40eb9b754c5646998952a",
      "text": "（……等等。玄武是一个人住的吧。\n他能拍家人的照片吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3e293b5ee93389a9b7bcf17a66b7f6a2d54b67552eb5a995eeb1189d5833170",
      "text": "初中时代……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94cc51ce5f741020d10c1724b537487e901e73c0f3bd48b27d4ec1ec861a8643",
      "text": "……今天又跟老爹吵了一架。真是的，\n我早说了自己根本不想当职业摔角手啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:865b5d0e494b8ce2f15b9d122df4e910dacce814a96d038d530a6380fbd7eb29",
      "text": "看来还是一如既往啊。不过，看着现在的你，\n想要让你继承家业的心情我也能理解。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0177b90f0d719d00548b36eaf42ac3f007c9ab5a81f48ffeb717d0bed3a51bf",
      "text": "毕竟像朱雀这么热血又强大的男人，世上可没几个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc0f4d7758057180d7580048d3b0d385784c02722e27ddb1840aa4eaff6f746d",
      "text": "嘿嘿。……那玄武家里怎么样？\n大家关系都好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65b98e63cb604c791023c1b542dcc278e63232062dd64f75ebd4e16944d62f97",
      "text": "嗯？谁知道呢。\n我父母在很久以前就已经过世了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71ea0163c44f9f630f23698296cabc0733a2bfa2890170c7a8150ee3e3873fb2",
      "text": "连长相都不记得了。之前可能没和你说过，\n我是在福利机构长大的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90f44d2b6ebd9a57ec1190ab4911c6ee2a33c6cd6c93e6de4a3322221071cac1",
      "text": "呵，吓到你了吗。现在我受一位有些渊源的\n熟人照顾，正一个人生活呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:505931a2b290b4bad8d660d1aaac9d4962587d086687cb3c013d73b2fb86616d",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。\n……虽然我不知情，但真是对不住了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_c:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c477b70073ae91f7f45e3f63223cfe6dfb9868bc0677a106233dcfaf96984dcc",
      "text": "别在意。\n我也觉得没必要特意提起，所以一直没说而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c1b090d2d89c1665b0e5139be826d01320ddaf16c416f41c448920335fdd4c6",
      "text": "……照片吗。\n拍的时候得多注意周围才行啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0a4c1948950a6675151c529de5221b6ff7bd366a1c8ddbe1c6a1b8e2c4bc4bc",
      "text": "检查照片的工作\n由我来做，请二位自由地去拍吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c950e02af782a2952febc27c9ec5b96b4a9e5dd14403af76abe0ef1a71dee8c",
      "text": "红井先生，喵子也很有人气，\n刚才那样的照片也拜托了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e94d9a5e2180bf0f03f8031c0775e4c1a0b36965f80190d5b4f5522324943a9d",
      "text": "包在我身上！\n喵子，等会儿给你拍超多照片哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74140fcb30a48cebba7138d5941478a774ffa8b004275301ed06419cf5449d94",
      "text": "喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd50ec40a8ca70502037132c78932597cede26c8b66ca2b92ce700017d137a3a",
      "text": "……！喵、喵子，别突然窜出来啊！\n……阿嚏！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc6c8fcab5c9cd75b01c9cfa7461b4e217c35f40d22136c2a5c190582decf985",
      "text": "……哇！\n没、没事吧！？玄武。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8064d628d732d21aebd64edcbeb1579a668d385179ee49bf33be147c0b35d459",
      "text": "咳、咳咳……总之，喵子就交给你了。\n我稍微离远一点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2acaf39229ab252004aab03bfe4c03fd9abbd2fddd0f988196d0c5580dcdc661",
      "text": "那么，今天的对台本就到此为止。\n很期待两位的照片哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acc41fc52898a83e0e86a0349fa84bc5907150a2cb97b5f36c1a220f2b039d91",
      "text": "（家人吗……说起来最近，那个人都没来过\n联络呢。算了，没消息就是好消息吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_e:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:045de37b1028b0a0b6df1cacbd39a7527805767c897033c1a6951afc2320667a",
      "text": "已经拍了这么多了啊。肉包，还有\n喵子……这张是学校的风景吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:537f9c8a2bec9773dd4be56b1b7caa33077ea98234a8f81cb8d2204d80f5c574",
      "text": "噢。是平时一直看着的天台景色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c248d98673bf277bde9a593de449e17a7b21098544336d4da5fbb8f5f022bb9c",
      "text": "虽然拍了各种各样的东西。\n但总觉得拍不出那种“就是这个！”的感觉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e8e0bffa3ef696b41cea99f2fd5d24063c36e4ba6cb227e2a47f35ba70d5342",
      "text": "时间还很充裕。在满意之前，\n请尽量多多尝试拍摄吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce402b41b28a325262dfd477170f5e725022a4ab4a8bab4bba59f13da7d70ca1",
      "text": "前几天我因为另一份工作和卷绪先生一起去\n拍照时，他也同样经历了一番摸索呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce9246f861a083d985af834b5b5e00b0a891dd81c52ee2ea36386dc2c4ea6cdf",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●番长。朱雀。\n让你们久等了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74bd8f6aad1090a4e39ccf2d79cfaa767662f318b401fd548fec7dedfc2a9f64",
      "text": "哦，玄武。比你之前说的时间要早嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccfd667c544091d353827162aea09e4f8a3488130ee94c57b709cbb5e931f25b",
      "text": "啊啊，事情比想象中处理得更顺利。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42ba924c5a66abfaeca39eac268c71710b4117229ebf83dd3f6724b53fbe028b",
      "text": "还有些时间，请好好放松一下吧。\n……啊，负责人先生过来了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34d8ab3c068a6776687a6e22ff5ed4d6aeebc1307f0178d6da0bba92c9e4b4b0",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n今天的拍摄，还请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fb865a9c034e00eb6a5c3f90f71842d9cc8de6f00f750096d3e5e2f0fa2d76b",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n我们这边才要请您多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cbf0ffa29b57892cafac884cc874eab8ad0be94563204d94b122e848d01e4a9",
      "text": "红井先生、黑野先生，如果带了那台相机的话，\n能不能让我们看看二位拍好的照片呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b43bc45bf2bc3f9643092443984a1bf4afd4692f4a32d6eb334fc5bd773e84d",
      "text": "噢，带了。\n虽然还没拍出最合心意的，但大概是这种感觉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c35b7d1cd66cce531163a6f9b795229177d90e70c9a26a4dbdc2619446b14105",
      "text": "啊，真不错呢！喵子也很可爱。\n真不愧是很有红井先生风格的照片呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcb42f38423018701345c38c954b636c9872656bad40603cdab0a8e71df538f6",
      "text": "黑野先生这边怎么样呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02fce20987fd82e3aa9ae465ffad8369bce2ecf1c2fd8a986bdd6ec0a2f7a9a1",
      "text": "抱歉。我还完全没能拍出\n能拿得出手的成果。比预想的要费劲得多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29d1f052ad93a24f4938483bdc79736e24fe83fd2479a04cb26f42faefddefaf",
      "text": "拍照这档子事，意外地挺难的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d24124b577918b9bb87ff606f465ae895fe1959dec794d83af09df4b8b8bc39a",
      "text": "哈哈，摄影一旦讲究起来，确实是没完没了的\n呢。我很期待黑野先生的照片哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd",
      "text": "啊啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:409b1d9e0f66817df85e79bfb0e63dadc74584dad762a4dd64d2c0e516ff54fa",
      "text": "（……玄武，没能拍出照片吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:702e0ece68096cec2cc17119bbae994f1437c9eda1a40c12315d9a47acf4f7b1",
      "text": "（而且，自打这次的工作开始之后，\n感觉他的话好像少了一些……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c20e3a7207136022b2dbb761669988a49d1beec41139dc6150181a15b87f0128",
      "text": "（这份工作对他来说，果然\n还是有点难办吧……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000107:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000116:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c78fb793d2486ab9317902643026f95f57e0f69b2aeda1dffbffab212bd3a05",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。能耽误一下吗？\n关于玄武的事，我有点在意的地方……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000118:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd7d26de244351674884375c0522f486045a256d1816d86068896a20bf7256b6",
      "text": "这次的工作，不是拜托我们要拍喜欢的、\n或者珍视的东西的照片嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000120:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:825e68d289591dd92a69509e3c174ee83b53079bdcdb85a504292168b81a5822",
      "text": "比如家人什么的……我在想，玄武这家伙，\n会不会其实根本提不起劲来啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000122:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cb70515e53602f02c42cf54f94432a2a0af331efb9fd82fcb43215eafc17bff",
      "text": "拍家人以外的照片\n也是完全可以的哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000125:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea453863a34285a4a25aa95e522d2868ee3feb667858f0c6d4c80c07f0cc621f",
      "text": "是那样没错啦。但是，一听到他说照片没能\n拍好什么的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000127:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23690f6381da3de127e345ba65fc21898ab9dd8d59307c142ae2bd20016c5648",
      "text": "玄武他那个……是一个人住的吧？\n以前在京都时候的事我也几乎没怎么听他提过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000129:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee818b3e279f19697c5dccbb8c05169f025e4da005ff25fe6d144f9b3a0ecac1",
      "text": "我就忍不住觉得他会不会有想说\n却说不出口的事情啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000131:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29d5c1221488612f88250c601aa408fce2bde21287fa0c92270e7d7d00cdeac7",
      "text": "我觉得直接去问问看他，\n才是最好的办法",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000134:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f8c35dd15b918857ef240d3213f803365a6f1d50b99b06dea55d705944c1a15",
      "text": "这样啊……也是呢。\n我去问问玄武好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_f:cmd-000136:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8856cca43377b9be9ff79a5298acf9ee904551a1ddd4f9ec0294f404e1423e6c",
      "text": "谢谢你啦，制作人！\n明天我就去问问玄武！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_g:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f15646b13b9f99fca4055ea9f9c4e7c45f92d5400293db167ef0ac2ecf5690da",
      "text": "放学后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b86b398544cbebde2e2ddb811cffc57b451e5dd94e2cb5caaa857b4e8f88065e",
      "text": "（……真是的，\n把补习的日期记错了一天）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_g:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c4b9b58bb4c94ddd71a00205d085e57041e96d546bfbb9e6a3641ea4b6d9409",
      "text": "（现在的话，说不定能追上玄武。\n好想问问他那件事啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70b16cf27307ccf9b5d5a4c97ab14ecbda5bf5ab3f260b878449b955a1b2dbb3",
      "text": "找到了。\n……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_g:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7273b01684cf06fc154b901164008830ebaf8bec29f38849c3947652701b01a5",
      "text": "（他在干什么呢？拿着相机对着那种草丛……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_g:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1222c3aa7569237d83347c11496a1401f6ad0e462d506cce0729d005f97183b",
      "text": "玄武！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_g:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f8cfbdf04c0f981fc156bae4b1359ec4f65ffc2a66e2a0bc99a1558f9fcd627",
      "text": "噢，是朱雀啊。你来得正好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_g:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c11c87b7172723b916b1c6d14c469263fd3515062662525a706f5d93d14b646",
      "text": "……嗯？出什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_g:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95295f9d8647b077fbb824390228a952a168d0e8257286b3dfed5060c9d67942",
      "text": "噢、噢。\n内个，我有件事想问你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_g:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edd75d42bad236064e1b53c77650a3da3afe19e724b0cd34b4e8084f7a12add6",
      "text": "什么事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_g:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04712cd5b870be80762d5eb809872a3776b39846e8e00f7c518d5290cd4b804c",
      "text": "玄武来这边之前待的地方，\n是个什么样的地方啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_g:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70a5178f30db7d9bb50d2380f90df5087b48dc3fdbddfd8a1d8e180e10ffbadf",
      "text": "对、对不起！突然问你这种事。\n那个，要是不想说的话不说也没关系！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:940ba2e9a46b7d923034f0823ba8cc085e9a89189724678d9d2e608c4c5bd91a",
      "text": "……只是因为平时几乎没怎么听你提起过，\n而且你又说拍照很难，我就有点在意了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b86914d7ae57a8d3983d08358bcb8f2ae172ba1865f29392a943b88c4c5be387",
      "text": "以前住的地方那么远，肯定没办法轻易回去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4916a8ba76b1167a083f502af444ad570d3c8611c436540825c823570008217",
      "text": "而且现在照顾你的人在海外，\n这你之前也说过吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_h:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e44a5934f01a616baa1fd2994a8f487e30af05d24861de9e1edcfbe5afb46227",
      "text": "所以拍什么家庭回忆的照片，可能根本做不到。\n但是，就算不是家人的照片……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9e4420ee04c1eae3db46b09170e9c3a3c7c55acb7c28b6064d4f324cafd45cf",
      "text": "不是，虽然家人也很重要，\n虽然我表达不太好，但哪怕从现在开始……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:094a554183a8f87874aeac89d493e8373992d51092c6b5c3f8458aeb1ef97729",
      "text": "和我一起，去拍超多快乐的回忆吧！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_h:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_h:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1889616b96148f09e7998def1ec60b8be19c0d92c2e1944bf51b4318568d2b96",
      "text": "……玄、玄武？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_h:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71d44981b77c6f9f7f24fe96c0d29178f3ebf32d5fa6dd1d2bbdb2b9efadd07c",
      "text": "哇啊！干嘛突然拍照啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_h:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d83e7d860bd5fe99ac09fe3f297225035e05832f0f6f92f4507330ca1368923",
      "text": "因为除了我们以外没别人在啊。\n我觉得是个好机会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_h:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1f36b7d5c6fe550cdc33f0492bb8f1726a2a554909a56ceb692c494a12642be",
      "text": "哎？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_h:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2567662d689b29a7ce7685038072048525fddc94290c9758ed1ff5e0fcbfab09",
      "text": "朱雀，来看看这个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_h:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dac2c69e91300fced769e9e33bd498f02128a4f90132025a5cee7b1f997eb2b",
      "text": "你拍的照片？\n这是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea1ad976ae83e31b6dcd2d8efe0f0f43440b552a9c615ab4a364354802635705",
      "text": "是前阵子工作去过的地方吧。还有事务所，\n这个是最近在看的书吧？剩下的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ac5cc4c6853098426284216ff0c399c1b01250f5c88bfecc16860bd8580b33a",
      "text": "……！这个攀爬架，\n是我们第一次见面的公园……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3962cee9ce282210e87604f6ee2c77b1157dab369ef13cc528eb166dda9247d",
      "text": "这里，是中华街吧。\n还有前几天一起去过的店。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58a4fb703d8e8b0cfb5bbc7dba133e5fa3070c23c4d96a834e9a361c4031de69",
      "text": "我本来想拍没有其他人入镜的照片，\n但时机一直很难抓。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eb32b5b6401eb9d4654ac835b0953b15f3b085c3eeb663be51e82b49d99a8a7",
      "text": "时机……那么，你之前说的\n“很难”难道是指。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7f26562730d73bd96b282c00d3b7a4faeb8fd5ae60cc9e1319cfe32058ba682",
      "text": "啊啊。公园也好中华街也好，人流量都很大。\n一直拍不到满意的照片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61b9a8f7cb823724c306e262a93c5781727bd92c740831d28d95aec457a272e1",
      "text": "原、原来是这么回事啊……！我还\n以为肯定是因为拍不了家人的照片才……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0df6197897cc7a0452fcd286599ee855d64a7e93fbef46a502aeac670bc7810a",
      "text": "呵，这样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6cd48fe0a75b435f6555fe406ee4f6236ef74a8e400653bf5e5fda0fdc86f9b",
      "text": "让你替我操心了啊。抱歉。确实，\n我从来没有详细跟你提过家里的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01a9500572c9994ef2871f5fd1c3d9e83099d038c23f557e12522666b0c79f9f",
      "text": "玄武……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9af0cd34254d3ec6e340fa1ccac65cb596e7b79216654e1fe1ee7bd8d379ef9",
      "text": "趁这个机会，不妨听听我的故事吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1917cbb60ac6b78bc1dd61a20707c17acbf5ee9d5963cbf03a671e9f921ecf45",
      "text": "以前稍微提过，我受亡父的一位老朋友\n照顾。那个人是个律师。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:117b4ece2b2b1a40c309b630af8d79098a3f6bc304c67016bb86de484287e6a0",
      "text": "他总是在世界各地奔波，虽然不怎么见得上面，\n但对我很好。……我很感激他。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba968d0b4ae6a8104be11d2f251cf1aefe5f22a9e39ade7660bfbf6055715865",
      "text": "然后是我长大的福利院，那是个好地方。\n只不过距离太远，没办法经常回去就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40ae06140b36bae1d630b6d29248f38442745134c131bd9dbb0cd669d6656237",
      "text": "……嘛，虽说经历了很多事，\n最后没办法继续待在那边了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_i:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d872af56f2775a21ef55bfd6afb328d4047557e212dbc0f8c5c179bb5e8780f9",
      "text": "但多亏了那样，我才遇到了你。接着遇到了番长，\n才得以做起了偶像这种行当。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:903aa5b95258631d87de3f3bd429b3deae8d823136db8635616e2b3e0881434b",
      "text": "所以说啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63409f703c65ad8308b927313e2906c3b9fc7cd01b37a3b657196a85332dc3d1",
      "text": "刚才朱雀说的那些快乐回忆，\n我早就拥有很多很多了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c644036acf9bfafd6245099faa92aeb6112cdd46cce581ee4f83823aef186dd7",
      "text": "看，那个也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b321d1bf1faf5351f2d11623a5894e238feb0e523a72f955ead782b3a342238d",
      "text": "刚才的草丛……？那种地方居然有花。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68e6d1bf0bcba32155e143ef34f8348607b78ad906cedd0dfdd44549ff7a7e96",
      "text": "啊啊。觉得挺不错的，就想拍下来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1d446c3b851e8a8150b3c438b2e32cb19db7f04674d9a2561c25c9a7f14ebff",
      "text": "换作遇见你之前，这种不起眼的小花\n我大概根本不会注意到吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01a9500572c9994ef2871f5fd1c3d9e83099d038c23f557e12522666b0c79f9f",
      "text": "玄武……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bec96c7c4c843d0b4e7cce3d4f7cce55cf8633110d2583c40dfb9c497922b2e",
      "text": "……嘿嘿。原来是这样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfe54de827dda8a92267b54b45fdb6867a1057e00392700c7a79a2b591410be0",
      "text": "那就让我们两个人去拍超多照片吧！\n把我们所有重要的东西全都拍下来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f35a36b6de597a08239982808759bf5672a5aad2da9a5700accc1bc45806a388",
      "text": "哈哈，这主意不错。\n不过可能根本拍不完就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000103:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da14df0fae1bd2115885d71d6f9fa4a299ee892ffdd72958c8ac01ead0151d79",
      "text": "今天也拍了超多\n照片哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000105:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c284081bebdc448648660a18e98dbb4fb45c2c5133d62250f94b44ae59ff4f5",
      "text": "也和学校的朋友们拍了\n大家笑得都超灿烂的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000107:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4496822744c50f50e1f7505a271b4256a52b81f3d5985d7d6ae2a8f61bd1b383",
      "text": "稍微看下嘛\n这个相机不用电脑也能\n直接传过去呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000109:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7c4944d068963e009d4644a674f74ef96b0c6ffae4e51cd9c354e86aca0e711",
      "text": "喂喂。\n你打算把所有的照片都发给番长吗？\n数量未免也太多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000111:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b35f6f6c9ef99cd22c47028084622faf71e3ce60d7c12b8011252979fb32557",
      "text": "明天还要见面的。\n到那个时候，再慢慢\n请人看就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000113:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88fe9c01848c2b50d57386202a46d92840e77f7e2d946d8758ac10595dc64625",
      "text": "噢！我知道了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000115:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eeda80e7114c83656f636255c35541d2f4a8e61fabdb546140c264e34ec3ab76",
      "text": "话说回来番长，这次拍的\n照片能送给我几张吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000117:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de5900fc9acd156fa481ae908988b250eb7272c193bc9bfadc0740021a114e17",
      "text": "当然，\n保密义务方面我可以保证。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000119:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cef598bf36308e9ca7c946678dc8a65a86af87ce8cf9af2434d47fc4b0134063",
      "text": "请稍等片刻",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000119:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6441d0bb60ec3851574fa31298fc13b43d9c8f4efef66de201706cd6a9c8fc48",
      "text": "当然可以！\n请稍等片刻。\n确认好了立刻联系你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000120:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9162607986cd7f2115775a58aea277be869ebcde33035072f3bedad0deaab3e",
      "text": "我去确认一下",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000120:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e80e43f43de64618b4e1f7f91909514a90ff43ec511c485664a4925579aa519",
      "text": "明白了！\n我去确认一下，\n不过我想肯定没问题的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_j:cmd-000124:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b1769aeeaab69fe258370a9542d0fc4e2fb1cb82fe6bd2914f1adab647c9569",
      "text": "报恩谢德。\n感激不尽，番长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_k:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25272b69ccaceb83122d4075a55b5f2a704e98371d17bd2eea7fa4db71f277df",
      "text": "要寄的照片就选这张，和这张吧。\n……呵，大家都是一副好面孔啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_k:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9ebdd282d2907c69df4c4ac46b5eb1f4856810c597b43899921a451b9629016",
      "text": "“好久不见。您那边可还好吗？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_k:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1d158c53042d690eec2a746cac7ac55f2c9e38aa2bea9318d9314230b2c1d10",
      "text": "“我这边一切如常。\n学业和工作都挺顺利的。请不必挂心”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_k:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a09c70e67443a846e5f9c95a23e49953f20a0953933baa8c7492f103cf63101",
      "text": "“另外，这次也随信附上照片”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_k:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19ee5a6d10b420ed2898aa7f0991d510594336bb2d59a2c0ab19137e8979956f",
      "text": "“是工作时拍的。\n就当是汇报近况，请收下吧”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_k:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb26b9cdafa7275ace449443de172979c5f6bd32ad341491fdfdd8a17b5de53b",
      "text": "“这是我现在从事偶像工作的事务所，还有\n受其照顾的番长”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_k:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:872fca43100a0a95da68d7f7d907e97eecd92bcf0203bcc7d269d6d448986ec4",
      "text": "“然后，这位是我多次跟您提起过的\n我的搭档红井朱雀”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30016_01:1_3_30016_01_k:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:989323a4038109d69fd9b5e5958874e09c308f8ac919081710dc8623cfb74577",
      "text": "“以后有什么事再联系您。回见”",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
